2	154	206	125	\N	Standard chunk	\N	.\n\nThere are three models in the series, with consistent hardware platforms, and differences mainly lie in computing power, number of interfaces, and wireless capabilities:\n\n| Model | Processor | Memory | Storage | Ethernet Port | Serial Port | Wireless | Typical Power Consumption |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| GTE-3000 | Quad-core 1.2GHz | 2GB | 8GB eMMC | 2 × Gigabit | 2 × RS485 | None | 6.5W |\n| GTE-3000S | Quad-core 1.2GHz | 4GB | 16GB eMMC | 4 × Gigabit | 4 × RS485/RS232 | 4G Full Network Coverage | 9.2W |\n| GTE-3000Pro | Eight-core 1.8GHz | 8GB | 64GB eMMC | 4 × Gigabit | 4 × RS485/RS232 | 5G + Wi-Fi 6 | 15.8W |\n\nGTE-3000 is the basic model, suitable for small-scale data collection on a single production line; GTE-3000S adds 4G uplink and more serial ports, suitable for workshops without wired networks; GTE-3000Pro has local inference capabilities, allowing lightweight vision detection models to run at the edge	[0.02764016,-0.014052175,-0.026730614,0.0064792736,-0.010860716,0.029344667,-0.02325045,-0.019552764,0.03243564,0.0657163,0.040610354,0.020106288,0.0117803,-0.028382162,-0.005357312,-0.0014905698,-0.01924641,-0.032195393,-0.048132677,-0.046039883,0.030227799,-0.009143273,-0.038700458,-0.07232522,-0.04493164,0.026739044,-0.023088846,0.005838438,0.04442456,0.02757172,-0.016745675,-0.046869732,-0.002340473,-0.036344726,-0.00937997,-0.011007128,0.0021244902,-0.005730805,-0.08513754,-0.023596529,0.029459303,-0.013038497,0.032345176,-0.022013268,-0.030678643,-0.03518344,0.027987624,-0.030763293,0.05238486,-0.022243988,-0.021124462,0.01476128,0.003614292,-0.031329926,0.016505739,-0.0012263211,-0.013976354,0.013449109,-0.045239046,0.010283786,0.032996632,0.035721038,0.05794317,-0.04775699,-0.009041152,0.023124157,0.0034733256,0.0023711175,0.0110512,-0.020464828,-0.037818473,0.024949564,-0.046314154,-0.05032823,-0.015201588,0.0075220834,0.026947305,0.037208527,-0.03457065,0.01565137,0.04289142,-