29	197	207	130	194	Child chunk	\N	Per person per day):\n\nSubsidy is not issued for round-trip travel on the same day that is less than 8 hours; if meals are arranged by the client or partner, the meal allowance for that day is not issued. If an employee is continuously stationed at the client site for 5 working days, an additional site stay allowance is issued according to Article 17 of the employee handbook.\n\nChapter Three: Expense Reimbursement\n\nArticle 8: Reimbursement Deadline: Submit the reimbursement form within 30 days after the expense occurs. For expenses spanning across years, the latest submission is by January 15th of the following year. Claims submitted after the deadline will not be processed.\n\nArticle 9: Document Requirements: The invoice name must be the full company name, and the taxpayer identification number must be accurate. Itemized receipts must identify the supplier, transaction date, amount, and applicable taxes. Meal and accommodation expenses must be accompanied by consumption details. Taxi fares must be supported by a trip itinerary, not just payment screenshots.\n\nArticle 10: Reimbursement Approval Authority:\n\nArticle 11: Payment cycle: Fixed payment dates are on the 10th and 25th of each month. Expense reports must be completed by the finance department within 3 working days before the payment date.	[-0.007077949,0.0027689957,-0.030104784,-0.001922468,0.03034059,0.029086672,0.036673628,-0.05588322,-0.0085157845,0.037581466,0.005693024,0.03727498,0.018271895,-0.014329247,-0.015088594,-0.00044711938,-0.034335148,0.02074365,-0.01244697,0.00107944,-0.023748558,0.04614216,-0.020083549,-0.031051675,-0.040635813,0.040609002,0.007993677,-0.00055046764,0.077399164,0.024343831,-0.027537495,-0.005370552,0.020968182,0.0056212414,0.012379193,-0.0019477136,0.03113238,-0.04276184,-0.00865992,-0.029178558,0.005204727,0.011681462,-0.013481574,0.0015559372,-0.029126545,-0.05534218,-0.049712785,0.0042371517,0.019191772,-0.013086742,0.022800775,0.