4	156	206	125	\N	Standard chunk	\N	LAN2 is default as business port, with factory configuration as DHCP client. LAN3 and LAN4 of GTE-3000S and GTE-3000Pro can be configured as switch ports, cascading downstream devices\n\nWhen the management port IP is forgotten, hold the RESET button for more than 10 seconds to restore factory settings, returning the management port IP to 192.168.1.10. Restoring factory settings will clear all collected point configurations; make sure to export the configuration file before operation.\n\n### 3.3 Serial Ports\n\nRS485 uses a 2-pin terminal with A and B lines. Serial port parameters support 1200 ~ 115200bps, default 9600bps, 8 data bits, 1 stop bit, no parity check. A maximum of 32 slave devices can be connected on the same 485 bus, with 120Ω terminal resistors required at both ends of the bus. GTE-3000S and GTE-3000Pro have built-in terminal resistors that can be enabled via a dip switch.\n\n### 3.4 Digital Input/Output\n\nGTE-3000Pro provides 4 routes DI and 2 paths DO. DI is inputted for dry interfaces, which are relay output, contact capacity 30VDC/2A. DO is often used to connect sound alarms and to export signals when collecting breaks or threshold limits	[0.0066783475,0.024486639,0.004034392,0.014409842,-0.056357123,-0.034669872,-0.00838161,-0.024384914,0.033794515,0.06466968,-0.016034808,0.0073356437,-0.006717005,-0.015819728,0.0064814156,-0.017080957,-0.012194015,-0.011159657,-0.016770987,-0.002825291,0.06566339,-0.031086007,-0.019845715,-0.043573093,-0.027899066,0.0077792467,-0.02750833,0.010164395,0.04091996,0.028786879,-0.021884922,0.0026777834,-0.04445462,-0.008315376,0.013276484,0.00010241772,-0.016191887,-0.046925176,-0.06879437,-0.03381712,0.023753809,-0.0076368153,0.02139755,-0.044826224,0.01187006,-0.009661625,0.0110498695,0.020402618,0.033469636,-0.041507587,-0.01806171,0.018723045,0.03297236,-0.017107708,0.0061620004,-0.02593244,-0.05102725,0.010690206,-0.032331314,0.0074863303,0.021385256,0.017834868,0.05088757,-0