7	159	206	125	\N	Standard chunk	\N	.\n\n## 6. Edge Computing\n\nGTE-3000Pro supports running edge rules and lightweight models on the device.\n\nEdge rules are written using a SQL-like syntax, for example:\n\n```text\nSELECT device_id, temperature\nFROM stream\nWHERE temperature > 85\n```\n\nAfter a rule is triggered, three types of actions can be initiated: reporting alarm messages, setting DO outputs, and calling write commands to downstream devices.\n\nModel inference supports ONNX format, with model files not exceeding 200MB. Typical scenarios include initial screening for product appearance defects, filtering out clearly qualified images at the edge to only upload suspected defective images to the central system for re-examination, reducing upward bandwidth usage by over 80%.\n\n## 7. Web Configuration Interface\n\nAccess `https://192.168.1.10` via browser, default account admin, default password Gl@2024. Password must be changed upon first login, with new password at least 10 characters, including at least three of the four categories: uppercase letters, lowercase letters, numbers, and special characters	[0.014577777,-0.010461709,-0.04064453,0.0054314113,-0.023221806,0.033826765,0.011619793,0.0020687324,0.018121077,0.07957115,0.016059587,0.014092894,0.0046931966,-0.016856596,-0.0059854845,0.012317286,-0.03231389,-0.016856601,-0.053060174,0.0024409592,0.05354705,-0.013405489,-0.055862404,-0.059714846,-0.06827295,0.016459484,-0.042669766,-0.021903325,0.06393485,0.0112299295,-0.028232478,-0.0055886465,0.022935474,-0.0008814907,-0.007436706,-0.029810121,0.025320655,0.005962532,-0.07654456,-0.02049312,0.030943569,-0.028827915,0.050516646,-0.050054755,-0.04658772,-0.035238225,0.004734604,-0.004802702,0.036206234,-0.02693634,-0.021464914,0.07065336,0.023676893,-0.041307826,-0.02346044,0.0008314888,0.008141067,0.01619911,-0.031763475,0.004153918,0.0331416,0.0124218855,0.049801722,-0.05097585,0.025897855,0.03684326,-0.024226012,0.03235085,-0.012517673,0.04148081,-0.034