27	195	207	130	194	Child chunk	\N	Northline Industrial Systems Inc. Travel and Expense Reimbursement Policy\n\nDocument Number: GL-FIN-2024-004\n\nVersion: V3.5\n\nEffective Date: September 1, 2024\n\nResponsible Department: Finance Department\n\nChapter One General Provisions\n\nThis system is applicable to all employees of the company on official business, daily expense advances and various types of reimbursement operations.\n\nArticle 2: Reimbursement follows three principles: approval before expenditure, truthfulness, and compliance with documents. Expenses incurred without approval are not reimbursable by the company.\n\nChapter Two: Business Travel Management\n\nArticle 3: Before traveling on business, submit a business trip application through the OA system, specifying the purpose of the trip, destination, start and end dates, accompanying personnel, and estimated expenses. Approval is required before booking tickets. In case of urgent business trips, travel may be taken first, but the application must be submitted within 1	[-0.02064489,-0.03433044,0.006094807,0.0043235025,-0.008741462,0.036223654,0.0187866,-0.047910176,0.020159673,0.037219718,-0.007515325,0.038903743,-0.02447095,0.009380824,-0.024940833,0.03676398,-0.04706453,-0.003814007,0.00030147439,0.0068205567,-0.0013801525,0.016982175,-0.034593143,-0.0369393,-0.061913464,0.015846737,-0.025345355,0.007768928,0.06252116,0.025225962,-0.014738107,-0.011613242,0.029498551,0.00645508,-0.008756298,0.015607617,0.02594093,-0.023098245,-0.029372888,-0.035535544,0.0070232064,0.019794151,0.039913267,-0.038786124,-0.020893604,-0.033997674,-0.019540492,-0.017494421,0.013916431,-0.02352534,0.043472853,0.039169963,0.00097604084,-0.028495165,-0.023521325,-0.019626975,-0.011855859,-0.037394498,-0.013275104,0.045975193,0.01974098,-0.0052149924,0.03069192,0.0009716028,0.05717736,0.007886453,-0.026679693,0.06022851,-0.008833563,0.013080536,-0.015007105,0.020602416,-0.0013463413,0.0052684136,-0.005114251,0.019061185,0.03165