90	206	207	131	203	Child chunk	\N	One confirmation of attendance.\n\nArticle 6: Out-of-office and business trip periods:\n\nIf an employee cannot clock in during out-of-office or business trip periods, they must submit an out-of-office or business trip application on OA, and the system will automatically exempt them from clocking in after approval. For employees stationed at customer sites, the project manager will uniformly confirm attendance in the weekly report.\n\nChapter 2: Types and Standards of Leave\n\nArticle 8: Annual Leave Entitled by Law:\n\nAn employee who has worked for a cumulative period of 1 to 10 years is entitled to 5 days of annual leave; 10 to 20 years, 10 days; and 20 years or more, 15 days. The cumulative work experience includes the time worked at other companies, and it is based on the social security payment records or the termination certificate.\n\nFor employees with a tenure of one year or more, an additional 2 days of welfare annual leave is granted; for those with a tenure of three years, an additional 4 days; for those with a tenure of five years, an additional 6 days. Welfare annual leave is combined with statutory annual leave	[0.017158559,0.0017299484,-0.013358244,0.021112842,0.017459536,0.013317865,0.001993748,-0.022457998,0.017416155,0.074028194,0.0028886155,0.031975698,0.01996803,-0.017702272,-0.024279108,0.018004417,-0.08457436,0.013161804,-0.04727283,0.028510202,0.015367081,-0.01068059,-0.039943364,-0.025242183,-0.02124531,0.030391702,-0.01349118,0.03751678,0.057707153,0.050028045,-0.048925336,-0.049669314,0.004914691,-0.052163485,-0.0148812,-0.029556133,0.07371976,-0.08196086,0.007308223,-0.007122123,-0.017812354,-0.0072491397,0.003079456,-0.027478307,-0.028422518,-0.06652652,-0.05080787,0.01991963,0.0153330155,-0.01537319,0.031062309,0.014489167,-0.013010035,-0.008009237,0.034408182,-0.014455239,-0.0368243,-0.02881369,-0.02958791,0.06698966,0.013184984,0.0063317567,0.0019279215,-0.050440244,0.014716689,0.044870984,0.02010289