168	458	208	134	\N	Standard chunk	\N	Use a multimeter to measure the input voltage. When it is below 9V, the device will power off and restart. Prioritize checking the power adapter and line voltage drop\n\n## V. Account and Security\n\n### Q17: What should I do if I forget the Web management password?\n\nGuest password cannot be recovered, so the device must be reset via factory reset. Operator and visitor account passwords can be reset by the administrator via [System Maintenance]→[User Management]. It is recommended to retain at least two administrator accounts during deployment.\n\n### Q18: What security reinforcement measures does the device support?\n\nData will not be immediately lost. When the network is disconnected, data is stored in local cache. GTE-3000 can cache up to 100,000 entries, GTE-3000S up to 500,000 entries, and GTE-3000Pro up to 5,000,000 entries	[-0.019142762,0.019735446,-0.022296913,0.03189606,-0.021642111,-0.0017121522,0.00053824094,-0.0039476547,0.049541928,0.055865504,0.002563513,0.026569465,0.0072038425,-0.022970721,-0.054852024,-0.017711816,-0.031920817,-0.02339936,-0.024073955,0.002000289,0.02708329,-0.016149433,-0.0022513787,-0.0612206,-0.035439953,0.011705842,-0.04903147,-0.00061670324,0.040536013,0.04596545,-0.022620361,-0.021961493,-0.0077283476,-0.019247945,0.008612358,-0.021206543,-0.0023150744,-0.004870091,-0.06696802,-0.025913365,-0.028582277,0.04445084,0.052352343,-0.0391293,-0.027449483,-0.017418748,-0.037919845,0.0070205857,0.019118726,-0.032442585,-0.008359361,0.062011402,0.011231375,-0.02735026,0.031360283,-0.03651774,-0.03833802,0.0072975387,-0.049794506,-0.005103157,0.028227737,0.063216306,0.06004471,-0.029491313,-0.0065084444,0.064949065,-0.01779588,0.018043673,-0.037462126,0.031664964,0.017162345,0.020672997,-0.013920712,-0.039771598,-0.007486281,0.070826456,-0.0077753887,0.043262675,0.013939656,0.013260937,-0.011505709,-0.02874791,-0.005575666,-0.0025377776,-0.027869247,-0.045519996,0.05747246,-0.012866694,-0.03491359