11	163	206	126	\N	Standard chunk	\N	.\n\n5. Connect Ethernet: LAN1 is the management port, LAN2 is the business port, after the network cable is done, use the tester to confirm the wiring order is T568B.\n\n6. Install the antenna for the wireless model, the antenna should be extended as much as possible outside the metal cabinet, installation inside the cabinet will cause signal attenuation of more than 10dB.\n\n7. Power on, observe the indicator lights: PWR constantly lit indicates normal power supply, SYS flashing once per second indicates normal system operation, COM flashing indicates data transmission and reception on the serial port.\n\n3. Commissioning and acceptance\n\nLaptop network port configured as 192.168.1.100/24, access https://192.168.1.10 via browser to log in to the Web interface, default account admin, default password Gl@2024, password must be changed upon first login.\n\nComplete sequentially: change the management port IP to the planned on-site address, configure the business port network, add southbound devices and points, configure northbound MQTT connection, start the collection group, confirm the status of each collection group is running on the operation monitoring page.\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n\n4. Daily maintenance\n\nMonthly maintenance: Check indicator light status, check if CPU and memory usage on the Web interface are consistently above 80%, check if remaining storage space is below 20%, export and archive operational logs.\n\nQualitative maintenance: clean dust on the device surface and heat sink, retighten power and serial port terminals, check if system time deviation exceeds 1 minute, and export a complete configuration file backup	[-0.029389633,0.00934959,-0.01475045,0.026742944,0.0032118221,0.013900927,0.009298027,-0.023514709,0.05387194,0.060932238,0.008282668,0.02321775,0.022135701,-0.0044711027,0.0059712897,0.019361034,-0.012429061,-0.020187555,-0.042259596,-0.022836596,0.046977416,-0.03713815,-0.04201463,-0.03703965,-0.037