100	219	207	132	217	Child chunk	\N	"who is in charge, who is responsible; who uses it, who is responsible." The Information Technology Department is responsible for technical measures and daily supervision, and department heads are the first responsible persons for information security in their departments.\n\n## Chapter Two Information Asset Classification\n\nArticle Four The company's information assets are divided into four levels based on their sensitivity:\n\n**Top Secret**: Core source code, firmware signature private keys, unpublished product design drawings, merger and financing materials. Access is limited to personnel on the authorized list, and all access activities are recorded.\n\n**Secret**: Customer lists and contact information, contracts and quotations, employee salary data, production process parameters, and customer site point configuration files. Access is granted based on job positions.\n\n**Internal**: Internal management systems, meeting minutes, project weekly reports, and training materials. All employees can access these, and they must not be disseminated externally.\n\n**Public**: Product brochures, publicly released technical manuals, official website content, and news releases. No access restrictions apply.\n\nArticle 5: The creator of a file is responsible for marking	[-0.012253413,-0.04308192,0.0055635925,0.0049805404,0.016168142,-0.006870123,-0.003526014,-0.05367112,-0.0043887664,0.021526815,-0.004026433,0.04439759,0.025873905,0.01291484,-0.035546616,-0.002375373,-0.04976978,0.046177957,-0.020244712,0.009295236,0.042623606,0.019031407,-0.04826297,-0.0024230166,-0.042553168,0.0031012867,0.027924834,0.026938831,0.05494162,0.03649561,-0.03884479,-0.006488063,-0.03157352,-0.029599415,-1.2218239e-05,0.005681799,0.07158022,-0.02810053,-0.037805866,-0.06141213,-0.011775659,0.031903997,0.04870033,-0.07001284,-0.060999844,-0.021724584,0.01612622,-0.018529704,0.029606313,-0.054418318,0.036744688,0.06604563,0.009796381,-0.013936531,0.020787584,-