24	176	206	128	\N	Standard chunk	\N	| 3 to 5 minutes |\n\nFive, Upgrade Operation Steps\n\nMethod One: Web Interface Upgrade (Recommended)\n\n1. Access the device management port https://192.168.1.10 via a browser and log in with an administrator account\n2. Navigate to [System Maintenance]→[Firmware Upgrade]\n3. Click "Select File" and upload the .glfw firmware package\n4. The system automatically verifies the signature and model compatibility. Once verification is successful, the "Start Upgrade" button becomes clickable\n5. Click "Start Upgrade", the page displays a progress bar. At this time, do not close the page or power off the device\n6. After the progress reaches 100%, the device automatically restarts. The Web interface will be accessible again approximately 60 seconds later\n7. After logging in, check the version number in [Operation Monitoring] to confirm it has been updated, and ensure all collection groups are in "Running" status\n\nMethod Two: Batch Upgrade\n\n| Use Northline Industrial Systems device management platform for batch deployment when more than 20 devices |	[-0.0033509573,0.010960833,-0.032928914,0.03524781,-0.03934293,-0.006592839,-0.009992925,-0.034409184,0.07704891,0.053661153,0.021593394,0.01940119,0.025098367,-0.028458852,0.008556803,0.03151345,-0.037744887,-0.04877594,-0.0021598788,0.0067477054,0.04756381,-0.003590022,-0.032697972,-0.048844606,-0.010287515,0.036835257,-0.04263973,0.0118512735,0.052234393,0.05038196,-0.031955265,-0.04341827,0.0035833726,-0.015449966,-0.04504309,-0.052895706,-0.047897525,-0.0038385948,-0.07598486,-0.036842093,-0.01572469,-0.0072375387,0.028196119,-0.021828169,-0.027606696,-0.052761283,0.017086342,-0.010361333,0.027550898,-0.007932367,-0.022555137,0.040911887,0.0056212377,-0.031539794,0.019514145,0.008350114,-0.030186506,-0.026890041,-0.053439353,0.040759053,0.048522275,0.0489191,0.038593367,-0.004204933,0.040098254,0.057516824,-0.010961456,0.033224825,0.0056055207,-0.020961618,-0.025281727,0.04399261,-0