170	460	208	134	\N	Standard chunk	\N	The certification certificate can be obtained in electronic format from the sales manager\n\n### Q21: Is the old model GTE-2000 still available for purchase?\n\nGTE-2000 was discontinued in December 2023. Currently, only spare parts and repair support are provided, with support until December 2026. New projects are recommended to directly select the GTE-3000 series. Point configuration files can be migrated from GTE-2000 to GTE-3000 via conversion tools.\n\n### Q22: Can secondary development interfaces be provided?\n\nYes. The device provides two ways to connect: RESTful API and OPC UA Server. The API documentation can be downloaded from the official website [Developer] section	[0.014778806,-0.0020942935,-0.06692419,0.060878567,-0.018488588,0.014987879,0.004952184,0.007844264,0.090550624,0.031580936,0.019018617,0.0015364588,0.0019624375,-0.0034870238,-0.012107997,0.001814608,0.0058583673,0.014468703,-0.01942533,-0.011781531,-0.020519523,-0.0073462715,-0.02543128,-0.0760673,-0.019062841,-0.006926022,-0.08778942,0.008232931,0.054859854,0.038129635,-0.041273423,-0.008209763,-0.027937772,-0.024258107,0.017740956,0.00056180375,-0.025837425,-0.024828378,-0.051738933,-0.011180306,0.0027552086,-0.018581534,0.029064314,-0.008229118,-0.034922704,-0.049508356,-0.0010367947,-0.0305257,-0.011782794,0.015134144,-0.002919256,0.050572604,0.011304691,-0.012821787,0.020252481,-0.006183201,-0.021029115,-0.011352149,-0.0038514335,0.00704672,0.022954058,0.021105133,0.025310129,-0.037375163,-0.040174276,0.031324793,-0.02485569,0.035277646,0.006507379,0.030347236,-0.025197938,0.006383037,-0.03357819,-0.023782497,0.0028569906,0.013786902,0.003952934,0.04539497,-0.018116748,0.03546809,0.04956918,-0.015847003,0.04062929,-0.05836397,-0.0056828954,0.011829187,0.04497022,-0.021810606,0.010038009,-0.00050064013,-0.036508083,0.048201572,0.007051723,0.0016917686,-0.013688111,-0.042883325,-0.0051484383,0.024863018,0.042701583,-0.018630024,-0.0032199577,0.0329493