74	186	207	129	185	Child chunk	\N	Article 15: Salary is paid on the 15th of each month, and if it falls on a holiday, it will be paid on the nearest working day. Salaries are transferred via bank, and personal income tax is withheld and paid by the company.\n\nArticle 16: The company provides the benefits described in each employee's agreement. Human Resources explains health coverage, retirement savings options, and payroll deductions during onboarding.\n\nArticle 17: Allowance items:\n\n- Lunch allowance: 30 CAD per working day, paid together with salary\n- Transportation allowance: 200 CAD per month, 500 CAD per month for fieldwork positions\n- Communication allowance: 100 CAD per month, 300 CAD per month for sales and after-sales positions\n- High-temperature allowance: 300 CAD per month from June to September\n- On-site allowance: 150 CAD per day for employees who stay on-site at the client's location for at least 5 consecutive working days\n\nArticle 18: Annual benefits	[0.0022720373,0.009711462,-0.0785495,-0.026951835,-0.008476085,0.03706721,0.014108666,-0.00025611816,0.008497924,0.052827183,0.0012798512,0.068684354,0.03061945,-0.018416045,-0.015763935,-0.013107513,-0.048794474,0.0021536485,-0.041640587,-0.013242953,-0.0148852365,-0.019313123,-0.04458842,-0.0583862,-0.029716011,0.03783148,0.024733407,-0.015951596,0.06636804,0.037266217,-0.07545971,0.034844447,-0.022924753,-0.07544279,0.03223217,-0.001654563,0.018622201,-0.039005075,-0.008277892,-0.015483054,0.0063358084,0.011884648,0.009886584,-0.028420243,-0.010890012,-0.040341143,-0.007571981,-0.004413905,0.04815692,-0.02702011,0.046905067,0.055240195,0.0036395898,-0.025365101,0.023657683,0.042381227,-0.029578703,0.004943265,-0.028672287,0.08113212,-0.02034549,-0.034194488,0.016089184,-0.020976849,0.0312523,0.004441386,0.0045439363,0.034216564,-0.014456226,-0.010983967,-0.017720444,0.044419024,-0.059755728,0.0056220535,-0.0058102794,0.031818587,0.019805199,-0.025543164,-0.030179737,0.029234393,0.04769842,-0