28	196	207	130	194	Child chunk	\N	Working day after departure. Approval is required before booking tickets. In case of urgent business trips, travel may be taken first, but the application must be submitted within 1 working day after departure.\n\nArticle 4: Travel approval authority: within 3 days, approved by the department head; 3 to 7 days, approved by the vice president in charge; more than 7 days or international travel, approved by the general manager.\n\nArticle 5: Standards for transportation:\n\nFor regular employees, an upgrade is allowed if the one-way flight duration exceeds 3 hours or the train journey exceeds 6 hours, requiring approval from the deputy general manager in charge.\n\nArticle 6: Accommodation Standards (per person per night, inclusive of tax):\n\nExcess accommodation standards require prior application and explanation of reasons. Any post-trip reimbursement will be based on the standard maximum, with the difference to be covered by the individual. For two employees of the same gender traveling together, it is encouraged to share a standard room, with savings of 50 CAD per person per night provided as a subsidy.\n\nArticle 7: Travel Allowance (per person per day):\n\nNo subsidy is provided for trips that return on the same day within less than 8 hours; customer	[0.01883863,-0.016732598,-0.017960591,0.0037466194,0.025778932,0.016796565,0.019390807,-0.013294321,-0.0044012438,0.04775937,0.016017435,0.049280472,-0.0036508408,-0.04771604,-0.03090668,0.010078372,-0.06836957,0.0076026106,-0.02246525,0.00048087517,-0.01426962,0.04110332,-0.03375563,-0.034383796,-0.023855314,0.023875581,0.014978602,0.007906054,0.06879194,0.034916334,-0.022061499,-0.010233579,0.031752676,-0.011039768,-0.0101693915,-0.015145285,0.032999646,-0.053910688,0.0070006815,-0.019830097,0.022144906,0.00033004762,0.015271235,-0.025775226,-0.043716267,-0.027492238,-0.017727453,-0.006125975,0.031878565,-0.03687322,0.040439226,0.014890978,0.005713013,-0.017290447,0.013387396,0.0