88	204	207	131	203	Child chunk	\N	Northline Industrial Systems Inc. Attendance and Leave Policy\n\nDocument Number: GL-HR-2024-006\nVersion: V2.3\nEffective Date: July 1, 2024\nResponsible Department: Human Resources Department\n\nChapter One: Attendance Regulations\n\nArticle 1: All employees must participate in attendance tracking. The attendance method is dual recording via the workforce portal location check-in and door access card swipe, with the workforce portal records as the primary reference, and door access records for anomaly verification.\n\nArticle 2: Two check-ins per day: one for morning arrival and one for evening departure. If the number of missed check-ins in a month does not exceed 3, the employee may submit a make-up check-in application via OA, which must be approved by the supervisor and will not be counted as an anomaly. If it exceeds 3, from the 4th missed check-in onwards, each instance will be treated as a late arrival.\n\nArticle 3: Tardiness and Early Departure:\nArriving at work within 30 minutes after the scheduled start time is considered tardy, and leaving before the scheduled end time by 30 minutes is considered early departure.\nNo more than	[-0.031152096,-0.02227446,0.011454654,0.02255621,-0.016146272,0.016312167,0.006396278,-0.025243614,0.028727733,0.0687874,-0.014536454,0.051974338,-0.011463194,-0.009927839,-0.034280375,0.0019081803,-0.04160298,-5.9705846e-05,-0.0064725424,0.038695615,0.011025076,0.02528059,-0.030158332,-0.027864702,-0.014770219,0.035189442,-0.03494183,-0.017107071,0.046247546,0.04536139,-0.04944556,-0.02766779,0.0038919218,-0.036327295,0.008096294,-0.0009550711,0.03611515,-0.041557804,-0.029422378,-0.016237667,0.006896927,0.0059858332,0.031579435,-0.06827801,-0.018581813,-0.056941964,-0.03916395,0.020983925,0.04198039,-0.02174179,0.02792309,0.046889037,-0.01147139,-0.0136237405,-0.002196154,-0.00848208,-0.020090908,-0.009506955,-0.017987609,0.06496763,0.032323375,-0.002045512,0.025755385,-0.00511635,0.032958604,