89	205	207	131	203	Child chunk	\N	30 minutes early departure within the previous day is considered as early departure.\nNo deductions will be made if the total number of tardy or early departures in a month does not exceed 2 times.\nStarting from the third occurrence, a deduction of 50 CAD will be made each time, and the performance evaluation will be downgraded by one level if the total exceeds 5 times in a month.\n\nArticle 4: Absence without prior approval:\n\nIf an employee arrives more than 30 minutes after the scheduled start time without prior approval, it will be treated as a half-day absence. If the employee does not show up for the entire day without proper leave procedures, it will be treated as a full-day absence.\nArticle 5: Absence Handling:\nA full-day absence will result in a deduction of twice the daily wage.\n\nIf an employee is absent for 3 consecutive days or accumulates 5 days of absence in a year, the company may terminate the employment contract according to the Employee Handbook, Article 30.\n\nArticle 7: Flexible positions are executed according to Article 12 of the Employee Handbook,	[-0.039212763,-0.0058607073,-0.029974833,0.00895182,0.0071804156,0.006098164,0.016572243,-0.004757823,-0.003704015,0.0985132,0.042864457,0.06551705,0.006938019,-0.043564655,-0.05910329,-0.015782563,-0.062263656,0.01770443,-0.040923554,0.028163359,0.0010631027,-0.0063738544,-0.036247306,-0.01565595,0.031843897,0.035347722,0.01902482,-0.019746628,0.08590592,0.023902263,-0.021448776,-0.007135212,-0.017766604,-0.03983174,-0.0057789814,-0.014965755,0.013723961,-0.0605991,-0.004487491,-0.021976976,0.01222646,-0.022804594,0.04165228,-0.06073407,-0.038418863,-0.06661264,-0.058011435,0.0138068115,0.025368415,-0.045033462,0.019365838,0.015415128,0.009519528,-0.038690973,0.020353734,0.0007505586,-0.025317136,-0.025563743,-0.034571566,0.09768507,0.026547411,0.020479023,0.013860905,-0.029396148,0.012764307,0.031906724,-0.024411248,-0.0048892167,-0.03596361,-0.014682454,-0.0