94	211	207	131	209	Child chunk	\N	For the death of maternal grandparents, parents-in-law, and spouse's parents, 1 day of bereavement leave is granted. If the employee needs to travel out of town for the funeral, additional travel leave will be given based on the ticket, up to a maximum of 2 days.\n\nArticle 16 Employment injury leave\n\nIf an employee is recognized as having a work-related injury, their salary and welfare benefits during the period of suspended work shall remain unchanged and shall be paid by the company on a monthly basis. The period of suspended work generally does not exceed 12 months. For cases with severe injuries, the duration may be appropriately extended upon confirmation by the labor capacity appraisal committee.\n\nChapter Three - Leave Process\n\nArticle 17 - All types of leave must be applied for via the OA system. In case of emergency, employees may first notify their direct supervisor by phone, but must submit the application within 1 working day after returning to work. Failure to submit the application within the deadline will be treated as unauthorized absence.\n\nArticle 18 - Approval Authority:\n\nLeave of 0.5 to 1 day         Approval by Direct Supervisor\nLeave of more than 1 day to 3 days        Approval by Department Head\nLeave for 3 to 10 days	[-0.005534297,-0.0026087281,-0.0074784607,0.024083894,0.012100261,0.020117005,0.006585115,-0.040581707,0.033621654,0.057268213,0.0020940506,0.029107213,0.018070659,-0.039571036,-0.020673571,-0.003949948,-0.030552285,0.0072363275,-0.04261777,0.018947352,-0.0118293,0.03486048,-0.033108942,-0.011295321,-0.028557368,0.008082135,-0.004806257,-0.022805575,0.054660577,0.012975481,-0.09402497,-0.028663374,0.0150329145,-0.052213684,0.011232188,-0.017625,0.043501444,-0.06942158,-0.017560808,-0.013134188,-0.0061810375,-0.0005661499,0.021541025,-0.012073924,-0.03005203,-0.060127586,-0.031476844,0.012395153,7.228432e-05,-0.009967223,0.026357953,0.03298041,-0.012089238,-0.04186574,0.046259407,-0.025