147	268	208	135	\N	Standard chunk	\N	.\n\nSix. Exchange Policy\n\n(1) Exchange During Warranty Period\n\nIf the same fault occurs in the device during the warranty period and remains unresolved after two repairs, an exchange can be requested. The warranty period of the new device is calculated based on the remaining warranty period of the original device, with a minimum of 3 months if less than 3 months remains\n\nIf non-human functional faults occur within 30 days of delivery, a new device can be directly requested for exchange without prior repair\n\n(2) Model Upgrade Exchange\n\nWithin 90 days after procurement, if the project requires an upgrade to a higher model (e.g., GTE-3000 to GTE-3000S), a price difference can be applied for to exchange the equipment. The price difference = new model price - original model price × 0.9, where 0.9 is the depreciation coefficient	[-0.035082653,0.009716067,-0.017899053,0.055962548,-0.021297859,0.0049247146,0.027887288,-0.0077236225,0.045552395,0.08446396,0.03789812,0.044595525,-0.0049933596,-0.03061736,-0.048669074,0.005566544,-0.054987106,-0.03092856,-0.031887975,-0.0027258424,0.00827473,0.0037431628,-0.014784149,-0.031664286,-0.014011043,0.03570951,-0.023291977,-0.015309427,0.09326997,0.033157784,-0.039649904,0.011028328,-0.020855702,-0.02066582,-0.023299888,-0.04759842,-0.04155927,-0.03630714,-0.053997118,-0.028084954,0.034633964,-0.027597062,0.03282302,0.018370716,-0.03940101,-0.032730896,-0.03649862,-0.02984332,0.026494179,-0.022255842,0.008263745,-0.005699855,0.014223037,-0.039880276,0.02637778,-0.017488347,-0.016677316,0.00021118068,-0.036808725,0.071180195,0.011285637,-0.0017130385,0.03980873,-0.059346624,0.020174494,0.056545384,-0.010549118,-0.005561076,-0.0008512726,-0.025762985,-0.005788551,0.019727182,0.012619171,-0.015951311,0.030566365,0.010134057,0.012211598,0.0074051735,-0.05198807,0.00012282966,0.08709184,-0.016196596,-0.013959844,-0.013986632,-0.017691143,0.03917708,0.042770717,-0.00612938,-0.019665455,-0.003