149	270	208	135	\N	Standard chunk	\N	.\n\n(3) Exchange Process\n\n1. Submit an exchange application, noting the original device serial number and target model\n2. After approval, the company will first send the new device (the customer must provide a deposit or sign a Device Return Commitment Letter)\n3. The customer returns the original device within 10 working days after receiving the new device\n4. After inspecting the original device and confirming no human damage, the deposit is refunded or the commitment letter is released\n5. If the original device is not returned on time, a charge will be issued based on the original price of the new device\n\nSeven. Packaging Requirements for Repairs and Returns\n\n1. Use the original factory packaging box; if unavailable, use a hard cardboard box with no less than 5 layers of corrugated paper\n2. Fill the device around with shock-absorbing material of no less than 3 centimeters thickness\n3. Small parts such as terminals and antennas should be individually bagged to avoid scratching the motherboard during transportation	[-0.047261685,0.002699131,-0.019231074,0.029531946,-0.027700642,-0.0075575477,0.012543261,-0.0023715412,0.04833257,0.061922558,0.027963083,0.0444586,-0.018102461,-0.031632986,-0.023946103,0.01060947,-0.023954747,-0.032238845,-0.027041389,-0.020479279,0.010841515,-0.021017201,-0.03134788,-0.02940413,-0.005722782,0.00078591856,-0.025967583,-0.009392131,0.085533656,0.022643097,-0.060073134,-0.002610381,0.036615487,-0.04860631,-0.004244804,-0.06414619,-0.0033001485,-0.037749015,-0.04824276,0.008548366,0.018086495,-0.020001722,0.043313254,0.0045464667,-0.05152734,-0.029509002,-0.014363761,-0.011751221,0.047226377,-0.042955033,0.018269904,0.00809674,0.0075434907,-0.026143664,0.043036263,-0.024264041,-0.028390765,-0.001130236,-0.031393945,0.062256344,0.04177988,0.016267195,0.030334104,-0.049208928,0.041203808,0.037107002,-0.028061446,0.040713042,-0.018756604,-0.002672898,0.007483506,0.03694001,-0.0015941941,-0.039